topics.detail:
Putin Aggression argues that Putin is financing war effort. Putin is invading Ukraine. Putin is humiliating America. Putin is committing genocide. Putin is pressuring Russia's economy. Ukraine Support argues that Ukraine should respond in kind to Russian aggression. Providing weapons to Ukraine is justified. Ukraine has the right to protect itself. Trump's actions hurt Ukraine.

@darthputinkgb.bsky.social: “I can’t defeat Ukraine on battlefield. My strategy is: 1 Bomb hospitals, schools,power & stations to create refugees 2 Fund anti western & anti refugee parties in west 3 Humiliate western leaders who want appeasement 4 Repeat”

Putin Aggression (50%) says Putin is aggressive in Ukraine. Ukraine Support (50%) says Ukraine should be supported.

Gaza Crisis argues that Israel's actions harm Gaza. Gaza suffers from Israeli oppression. Zionism Condemned argues that Zionism inflicts harm on Palestinians and Arabs. Zionism is a racist ideology of ethnic cleansing. Anti-Zionism is used as a shield to commit murder. Zionism prioritizes Jewish feelings over Palestinian lives. Israel Condemned argues that Israel's history of being attacked does not justify its aggression. Israel's military actions have killed many innocent civilians. Israel Genocide argues that Israel's actions are genocidal. Israel is clearing rubble for military outposts over human remains. Israel's invasion is a genocide. Israel stages fake terrorist events to justify genocide. Israel's occupation of Palestine is genocidal.

@zeteo.uk: ““You were right”: Ed Miliband acknowledges the millions who have protested over Palestine. He promised Labour would match its words with action against settlements, occupation and alleged war crimes in Gaza at the Labour Party Conference. Subscribe to zeteo.uk”

Gaza Crisis (34%) says Israel is oppressing Gaza. Zionism Condemned (28.8%) says Zionism is criticized as racist. Israel Condemned (22%) says Israel is criticized for its actions. Israel Genocide (15.2%) says Israel is committing genocide.

Labour Fails argues that Labour failed to amplify its policies. Labour opposes protests for Gaza and climate change. Labour's Brexit stance is unclear. Labour may lose older voters. Tories Tory argues that Tories are arrogant and out of touch. Tories are appealing to uneducated voters. Tories are losing support and becoming irrelevant.

@samfr.bsky.social: “It's quite hard to believe she's still managing to keep the Tory score below Sunak levels despite Labour losing two years, fiscal mess, and Farage being cosmically unpopular.”

Labour Fails (55.2%) says Labour is criticized for its actions. Tories Tory (44.8%) says Tories are being criticized.

Man City Cheating argues that Man City's hypocrisy is evident in their cheating. Cheating on this scale makes a mockery of everyone. Man City faces calls for relegation after being found guilty of 115 charges. City Disrespected argues that City disrespects sporting integrity. City Cheating argues that cheating undermines the league. City's cheating hurts working class communities. City Faulted argues that City is criticized for its impact on football.

@paultenorio.bsky.social: “Asked about Manchester City's rule breaches, #USMNT Mauricio Pochettino said "If it’s true that the 114 rules were broken, then we lived through a period of deception." "It’s deeply sad."”

Man City Cheating (30.4%) says Man City cheated on a large scale. City Disrespected (26.1%) says City disrespects sporting integrity. City Cheating (23.9%) says City cheated to win. City Faulted (19.6%) says City is criticized for its impact on football.

Oil Reserve Release argues that releasing oil reserves eases pressure on global fuel supplies. Draining strategic reserves leads to higher oil prices. Diesel Prices argues that Diesel Don is tanking the GOP. The price of diesel is going up due to war. Soaring diesel prices are driven by the U.S. conflict with Iran. Diesel shortages and prices are unusually high compared to other fuels. America needs stable diesel prices. Fuel Economy Rollback argues that Trump's rollback helps car buyers. Rollback prioritizes fossil fuel revenue.

@peipolitical.bsky.social: “Trump: We took over the country of Venezuela. We're taking out billions and billions of dollars of oil. And we're going to be filling up very shortly our strategic reserves for nothing. We’re going to say that oil goes there. #cdnpoli”

Oil Reserve Release (41.3%) says Countries release oil reserves to ease pressure on global fuel supplies. Diesel Prices (32.6%) says Diesel prices are increasing. Fuel Economy Rollback (26.1%) says Trump rolls back fuel economy standards.

Trans Rights argues that moderating against trans participation is bad. Trans women don't diminish cis women's identity. Anti-trans propaganda is spreading. Trans people face exclusion and hate speech. Gender affirming care helps trans kids. Trans Women Safety argues that Trans women are not a problem in public toilets. Trans women represent no more harm to cis women than cis women do. Trans women are a valuable minority and not a threat.

@sloanelysbeth.bsky.social: “every time i call out transphobia on this platform i get mass blocked. it wasn't that long ago things working the other way around on here. white liberals have wrecked yet another place that was initially used as a *relative* safe haven by minorities.”

Trans Rights (83.3%) says Trans people deserve full participation in society. Trans Women Safety (16.7%) says Trans women pose no threat to cis women.
